{"availability":"available","full":"The-AI-Alliance/gofannon","name":"gofannon","description":"A web app for rapidly prototyping AI agents and the lightweight web UIs that wrap them—build flows, preview interactions, and share agent-driven experiences without lock-in.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":69,"forks":18,"created":"2025-01-30T01:38:35Z","updated":"2026-08-07T20:54:17Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://the-ai-alliance.github.io/gofannon/","topics":["ai-agents","data-sources","decision-flows","no-lock-in","open-source","prototyping","python","rapid-prototyping","react","stakeholder-engagement","tools","ui","webapp","workflow"],"demo":"https://the-ai-alliance.github.io/gofannon/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:17:32.797Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:17:32.797Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:17:32.797Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:01:23.940Z","stars":68,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:03:35.432Z","stars":69,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:32:39.737Z","stars":69,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-19T22:17:32.797Z","stars":69,"forks":18}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Gofannon is a provider- and model-agnostic toolkit and web application for prototyping AI agents and the lightweight web UIs that wrap them. Subject matter experts compose tools, data sources, and decision paths through a guided interface, preview agent interactions in real time, and hand off working agent-driven experiences without committing to a single AI framework or model provider.","Gofannon is the Welsh god of smithcraft. See About the name for the story behind the choice."],"features":["Prototype agents quickly. Compose tools, data sources, and decision paths through a guided interface, and iterate with real-time feedback.","Design lightweight web UIs. Pair agents with forms, chat surfaces, and dashboards to validate user journeys; export or embed pro